no less than

364
00:06:32,420 --> 00:06:32,860
what we know

365
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:34,420
about the disease itself.

366
00:06:34,420 --> 00:06:35,160
Plague placed

367
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,160
