400
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:14,520
Where many

401
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,640
people had died,

402
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:16,780
fields remained with too

403
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:17,820
few hands to work

404
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:18,800
them and workshops

